{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54797","headline":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占北斗第十四（京本作「占斗第四」○十六首） 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占北斗，太白入其中。\n定主将军逢战死，城营难守乱人民，大小在（辛本、川本作「走」）西东。\n（太白入斗，将星入度也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}